Basis for inclusion
-------------------

Each image identifies the specific game it sits on, on a card that launches the
shareware release of that same game from this site. The use is nominative and
non-commercial, each image is a downscaled copy well below print resolution, and
none of them substitutes for the original work or affects any market for it.

If you are a rights holder and want any of this removed, open an issue on
https://github.com/sorfeb/personal_web and it will be taken down.


